; Example DSL Script: Basic Green Circuit Production
; This demonstrates the DSL syntax for building a simple factory

; Clear the build area first
clear 0 0 30 20

; Step 1: Power infrastructure
; Place medium electric poles in a grid
power-pole-medium 5 5
power-pole-medium 15 5
power-pole-medium 25 5

; Step 2: Copper cable production
; Input belt for copper plates
belt-blue 0 10 :e
belt-blue 1 10 :e
belt-blue 2 10 :e

; Pick up copper plates from belt
inserter-fast 3 10 :n

; Assembler for copper cable
assembler-2 3 11 recipe:copper-cable

; Output copper cable
inserter-long 3 12 :e

; Step 3: Green circuit production
; Input belt for iron plates
belt-blue 0 15 :e
belt-blue 1 15 :e
belt-blue 2 15 :e

; Pick up iron plates
inserter-fast 10 15 :n

; Green circuit assembler
assembler-2 10 16 recipe:green-circuit

; Pick up copper cable (from step 2)
inserter-fast 9 16 :w

; Output green circuits
inserter-fast 10 17 :s
belt-blue 10 18 :e
belt-blue 11 18 :e

; Done!
; The factory is now built and ready to produce green circuits
